ShaderMake compiler contract
Base: 4f1ffd56dac27fc3d620ad7efeee42b4dd71fa72
License: MIT (upstream LICENSE.txt and ThirdPartyLicenses.txt)

Expose explicit precision/profile/extension/define policy controls and include
them in the upstream signature. Preserve relative compiler/source paths when
requested, use native filesystem cwd discovery and encode diagnostic paths as
UTF-8; discover executable metadata with the native Windows path. Sparkle supplies contained ASCII paths to the nested shell; this option
is not a general shell-argument serializer. No compiler/process implementation
is added. Keep the shared source cache unmodified.

